<title>SPAIN: Calendar of Spanish companies 1997 Q1 results.</title>
<headline>Calendar of Spanish companies 1997 Q1 results.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is a preliminary list of expected dates for release of major Spanish companies' 1997 Q1 results. Further dates will be added as they become available:</p>
<p>    April 22/25:	  BCH</p>
<p>    April 23:	     Banco Popular and Argentaria</p>
<p>    April 29:	     Banco Santander</p>
<p>NOTE: Under bourse legislation, listed companies should release 1997 Q1 results by May 16.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom  +34 1 585 2160</p>
</text>
